00:30:58,460 --> 00:31:01,420
then you maintain property rights for an extra time.

204
00:31:01,420 --> 00:31:04,700
The problem is property rights is not the last one.

205
00:31:04,700 --> 00:31:06,640
They are very short.

206
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:10,240
The problem is now property rights basically

207
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:14,290
are procedural and not substantial.

208
00:31:14,290 --> 00:31:18,980
They tell you under what conditions you can take it away.

209
00:31:18,980 --> 00:31:22,480
So that's the job as a property, right?

