00:31:47,550 --> 00:32:02,140
the rest have not. In this country, if you look at minorities, handicapped, women and the old, 45% of our legal force have preferential job rights to be.

215
00:32:02,140 --> 00:32:12,760
That's twice as many as in Japan. Now we can get out of it through bankruptcy and so on, but not otherwise. That's not very satisfactory.

216
00:32:12,760 --> 00:32:22,680
How do we have the flexibility, the property rights you already have, perhaps a labor force.

